l bucket list, don\u2019t forget to add \u201cShiga\u201d!  Shiga prefecture, located just a few minutes away from Kyoto, is a perfect place to enjoy Japanese traditional sceneries and many more, while avoiding crowds.\nThis app is ultimate travel guide of Shiga!\n\nWhat\u2019s in \u201cShiga VR\u201d?\nYou can find 6 different spheres on the map once you put on the headset. Each sphere is the gateway for a unique experience through Shiga.\nAll you need is to just grab the sphere you want to experience and throw it!\n\n6 unique experiences:\nTo celebrate autumn leaves\n\u30fbKeisoku-ji Temple, Nagahama\nTo enjoy summer in Shiga\n\u30fbNorth Lake Biwa Firework Festival, Nagahama\nTo experience the change of seasons\n\u30fbSakamoto Cable Railway, Otsu\n\u30fbAvenue of Metasequoias\nFly above Lake Biwa as a \u201cBirdman\u201d\n\u30fbJapan Birdman Rally VR, Hikone\nSwim through Lake Biwa as a freshwater fish\n\u30fbLake Biwa Museum, Kusatsu", "short_description": "If Kyoto is on your travel bucket list, don't forget to add its neighbor \"Shiga\u201d!\n\u201cShiga VR\u201d is a travel app to guide you to 6 different locations of Shiga in a unique manner.\n\nThe 6 different locations are:\n\u30fbKeisoku-ji Temple, Nagahama\n\u30fbNorth Lake Biwa Firework Festival, Nagahama\n\u30fbSakamoto Cable Railway, Otsu\n\u30fbAvenue of Metasequoias\n\u30fbJapan Birdman Rally VR, Hikone\n\u30fbLake Biwa Museum, Kusatsu"}]}, "developer_name": "ytv VR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ytv.co.jp/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ytv VR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ytv-vr.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EXPERIENCE_360_NON_GAME", "EXPLORATION", "TRAVEL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommend